{"steam_appid":4637870,"steam_name":"Smashing Bottles","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4637870/542259965/44b4fc7fa14ef95ae14e6ab595d67c1a9932032b/1786750198/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786771145","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257335030/b8f34eadde6fa4f8c4b813c83089f9fdbddca820/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786771145","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/481156a32b8662914fcf0d7792def66c1ce60e57/ss_481156a32b8662914fcf0d7792def66c1ce60e57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787756184","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/8943e0e04e34ea6a8b7fd3aa2cfed9731fdc0456/ss_8943e0e04e34ea6a8b7fd3aa2cfed9731fdc0456.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787756184","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/9f530f4760c0739aac67278137bb333f503692f4/ss_9f530f4760c0739aac67278137bb333f503692f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787756184","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/aa18116425989c5cb79bb10881c837938869856e/ss_aa18116425989c5cb79bb10881c837938869856e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787756184","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/5d4578af74807e98dde48ae631d186a0786c9d0a/ss_5d4578af74807e98dde48ae631d186a0786c9d0a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787756184"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smashing Bottles is a short and satisfying incremental game where you break bottles to earn money, upgrade your bat, discover new bottles, and cause chaos! Will you smash enough bottles to buy the universe?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smash Bottles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/16a1d56d2e8abaab75b0c43d399eaa7b.poster.avif?t=1787756184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/16a1d56d2e8abaab75b0c43d399eaa7b.webm?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/16a1d56d2e8abaab75b0c43d399eaa7b.mp4?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Upgrades!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/ab91d814f1b8733262eb02e0d6a9fe33.poster.avif?t=1787756184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/ab91d814f1b8733262eb02e0d6a9fe33.webm?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/ab91d814f1b8733262eb02e0d6a9fe33.mp4?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover New Bottles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your money to buy special bottles that increase your profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/36d9b361feca99d692a8054ee09f54e2.poster.avif?t=1787756184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/36d9b361feca99d692a8054ee09f54e2.webm?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/36d9b361feca99d692a8054ee09f54e2.mp4?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy the Universe!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To cause more chaos, spend your shards to prestige and obtain SUPER powerful upgrades in exchange for resetting your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/1606cdb517049a429f4becbd851008f2.poster.avif?t=1787756184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/1606cdb517049a429f4becbd851008f2.webm?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/1606cdb517049a429f4becbd851008f2.mp4?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the alternate Idle gamemode for a a longer, more chill experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/9497366f27e4320ea6336d1f226b4bce.poster.avif?t=1787756184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/9497366f27e4320ea6336d1f226b4bce.webm?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637870/extras/9497366f27e4320ea6336d1f226b4bce.mp4?t=1787756184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying glass smashing gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round based incremental progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system with unique upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable bottle types with unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate Idle gamemode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets that unlock cosmetics for your bat and bottles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banging soundtrack!</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+ (x64 only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K, AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (Pascal), AMD Radeon RX 460 (GCN 4.0) or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Blue Makes Games","Quinn Dymalski"],"publishers":["Blue Makes Games","Quinn Dymalski"],"release_date":"Aug 24, 2026"}